   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at reaching a debt relief in moldova&apos;s bond debt that is comparable with soultions being discussed with other categories of creditors. This includes financing of Moldova&apos;s negitioations with bondholders and legal support.Sida will contract a law firm to support Moldovan government. The Moldovan partner is the Min of Finance. Sida will aslo contract a Swed. consultant to assist.</narrative>
